The decoder kept the DPB plus what downstream asked for, at least two, as source buffers: 16 of
0.87 MB for the phone's 1280x464 HEVC with its 12 pictures. LIVI copies every frame into its own
scanout buffer and hands the decoder's back at once, one buffer beyond the DPB is enough.

